        "TileImage": "$($repository 010e451b-99de-4a73-a6df-520158636654).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rThis is a personal contract made by Bruce Lee. Your targets are the administrator and the liaison officer of the Concord Union&apos;s Thailand branch, and two special exhibits carried and protected by them, the Golden Dragon Scissors and the Jade Dagger.\r\rThese two stolen artifacts will be taken to the grave with Wu after the memorial meeting, but Lee wants you to take out both officers and retrieve the lost treasures, before taking them back to China.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
